{"id":128836536655551,"name":"[🎃] Alkedion PVP","desc":"ALKEDION PVP\n\nWelcome to Alkedion PVP, a fast-paced third-person shooter where every fight is all about skill, movement, and teamwork. Challenge players from around the world, create your own clan, and prove yourself on the battlefield.\n\n🎮 Game Modes\n\n• Free For All (FFA)\n• 1v1 Duels\n• 2v2 - 5v5 Team Battles & Clan Wars\n\n✨ Features\n\n• Smooth and responsive third-person combat\n• Roll, sprint, crouch, and outplay your opponents\n• Collect unique weapon skins and effects\n• Create or join a clan and compete with others\n• Climb the leaderboards and earn rewards\n• Frequent events, giveaways, and new content\n\n🏆 Progress\n\nWin matches, unlock rewards, improve your skills, and become one of the strongest players in Alkedion.\n\n🖥️ PC Controls\n\n• WASD – Move\n• Mouse – Aim\n• Left Click – Shoot\n• Right Click – Aim / Zoom\n• Space – Roll / Dodge\n• Shift – Sprint\n• C – Crouch\n• R – Reload\n• V – Open Inventory\n\n❤️ Enjoying the game? Like, Favorite, and Follow to support future updates.","path":"/game/128836536655551-alkedion-pvp","slug":"128836536655551-alkedion-pvp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7a143d4f3cccde42c80d87bf99f304ff538a7c469f65d37a7fbc85468707a045.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d7eb85f4cd30d07fa42e216a70f2db23/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":473,"visitor":8833574,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-07T05:45:30.390Z","creator":{"name":"Alkedion Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6abf971ba8075415addcf6fa","title":"Best Silent Aim Instant Hit","game":{"_id":"6a77d38bc8673fdf1e040ca9","gameId":128836536655551,"name":"[🎃] Alkedion PVP","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/77e6d942f4241c50c38268d692671785e5d284ba149b6fefb85937a68602e626.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-ae70ec1ed9f8d52134a530c54699fc69-820